  _speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5b0efb9ebf8804f39a64eb09f5e67af0, type: 2}
  _lines:
  - Sad. You would have been a great asset.
  - Or perhaps not, since you are determined to live a life of laziness and filth.
  - We will meet again.
  - At every interview... performance review... between every line of every email...
  - And <i>especially</i> in Zoom webinars.
  - One day your Spirit will break. You will see.
  _options:
  - _optionText: ((he is right about zoom calls...))
